Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:13.95,OT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1695,0)\an8\fs50\pos(946.667,122)}超{\c&H1400D3&}电王{\c&HFFFFFF&}三部曲 {\c&H00F0FF&}黄之章 {\c&HFFFFFF&}寻宝{\c&HFFEE11&}Diend{\c&HFFFFFF&}的偷盗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.56,0:58:27.94,OT,,40,0,0,,{\fad(567,0)\an7\fs50}东京都足立区绫濑8丁目9番地 水岛小百合
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.19,1:07:33.36,OT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,0)\an8}良太郎专用
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.41,0:58:47.42,OT,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs50}'本月推荐 万寿菊 水岛小百合'
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.14,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,闻到了 闻到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:06.77,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,有异魔神的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:08.81,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我刚泡完澡 又白洗了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:10.86,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,前辈 真的有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:13.36,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:16.49,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,快跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.87,0:01:20.37,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,姓桃的确实有个好鼻子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:22.45,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,能嗅出异魔神的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:24.81,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,也就只有鼻子管用了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.83,0:01:25.50,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:28.92,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别夸我了 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:29.75,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别夸我了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:31.67,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,又没在夸你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.51,0:01:34.13,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.59,0:01:38.39,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,快追
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.55,0:01:40.30,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:41.72,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:42.31,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.35,0:01:42.72,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.18,0:01:44.81,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,那个异魔神已经进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:46.89,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,到底在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:47.60,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}前辈 那边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:47.42,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,快看快看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,看来是和那个男人签订了契约吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:54.90,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:57.24,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我好像在哪儿见过那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:01:59.11,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,你认识的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.41,0:02:01.32,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,他是谁 是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.70,0:02:02.62,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别晃我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:05.70,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,想不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:08.37,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,你这么早就出现衰老症状了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:09.79,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.04,0:02:11.54,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别把我当老头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:12.46,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}比起这个 先对付异魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:17.33,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你小子 是不是在哪里见过我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:23.13,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,混蛋 要打架吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:28.22,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,我来当你的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:29.70,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:40.09,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:42.28,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,你逃不掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:42.78,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:52.96,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是野上良太郎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:02:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,愿望实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:12.52,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.73,0:03:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,契约完成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:22.53,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,这是什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:25.20,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}看来他的愿望是见到良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:26.83,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:28.70,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,总之先去追异魔神吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:29.41,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:43.89,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,列车来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.01,0:03:44.64,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我们上车吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:45.68,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.64,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎 快来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:48.47,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.74,0:04:11.66,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,老子 骑摩托登场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.67,0:04:14.42,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这么快就追来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.59,0:04:20.67,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不需要铺垫直接上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:26.51,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:30.31,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,必杀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:31.64,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,FULL CHARGE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:34.44,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,想当我的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:36.69,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你还早100年呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:55.00,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,已经解决了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:57.00,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,真是个不禁打的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.75,0:04:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那个契约者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么想要见我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:03.63,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那点小事无所谓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:05.63,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,小鬼 去找通行证
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:08.39,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,不要 真麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.55,0:05:10.31,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,明明是桃塔罗斯把它扔出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.43,0:05:11.35,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你有意见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:13.85,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,明知道没有通行证我们就回不去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.89,0:05:15.31,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,还老是把它丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.35,0:05:15.98,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,就是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:17.85,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:20.57,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,FULL CHARGE之后还拿着那东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:21.52,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,一点都不帅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:23.19,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,搞不懂你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:23.32,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}你怎么老想这些
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:25.03,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好了 一起去找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:26.65,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:27.95,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,你自己去找
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:30.08,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,大家一起找会比较快吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:31.79,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,好啦好啦 一起找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:34.37,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,找吧 找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:36.04,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,快 良太郎也动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:38.50,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,在这附近吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:42.05,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我记得就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.42,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,难道掉河里了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要找的东西在这儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那个契约者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Den-O的通行证和Den-Liner
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我都收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:55.20,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.52,0:05:56.56,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,休想
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:56.94,DefaultTOP,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,为了我 你们干得很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就把那份回忆当作一生的宝物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:03.77,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.74,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那家伙就是喜欢宝物的小偷骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:07.53,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,小偷骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.57,0:06:09.78,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,你倒是早点想起来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:12.08,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,名字确实是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:14.74,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,二恶英
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.87,0:06:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是大树
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,海东大树
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:22.04,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,小龟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:25.51,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,头好晕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:28.76,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我最怕侧着翻滚了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真是头疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在的行为是非法乘车
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.41,0:07:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意偷 你应该为此感到骄傲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你利用异魔神把良太郎引出来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了抢夺Den-Liner对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了他 我才能盗取时间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,今后我就能自由前往想去的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就到停车时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:01.56,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋小偷 气死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:04.56,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,着了那家伙的道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:08.32,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,你太过在意异魔神了 姓桃的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:09.57,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:11.28,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯是笨蛋 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:12.24,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:17.28,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,话说 我们现在被困在这个时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,异魔神是通过契约者的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,回到过去对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那个叫海东的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在这个时间有什么回忆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Den-Liner回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:47.15,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,管他呢 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.84,0:08:48.45,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你对这段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:08:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎有着不寻常的执念
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一般来说车票用过一次就会消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.85,0:09:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,又回到了相同的时间呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这个时间里到底有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.32,0:09:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那还用说 当然是宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉比异魔神还要恶劣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 不能放任他不管
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:02.14,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,夺回Den-Liner
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:17.15,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,浦 快跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,大家等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,海东 把车票还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那儿乖乖看着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,即使是小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.43,0:10:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会手下留情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那是 这个时间的海东大树
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,果然不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你想在这个时间里做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:11:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:11:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:02.05,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:04.93,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,站住 你这个小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:05.39,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,即使抹杀自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,也无法消除你的罪孽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.87,0:12:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,海东大树
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,黑崎怜治吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,缠人的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:37.34,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:39.21,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,又出来个奇怪的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,警告
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,来自未来的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,无法消除过去的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.31,0:12:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我回到过去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.23,0:12:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也不能抹杀抛弃我的母亲一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:12:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,时间悖论吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:12:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,只是想试试是否是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真是嘴硬
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这么想抹杀自己的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就替你实现吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.59,0:13:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,变身了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,海东大树
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你因涉嫌盗取时间而遭到逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.43,0:13:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我记住
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.10,0:13:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我最讨厌就是被剥夺自由
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:40.57,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,KAMEN RIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:42.23,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:43.53,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,DIEND
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:13:59.04,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,好强 好强
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.00,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,事情越来越有趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,KAMEN RIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,RIOTROOPER
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,右方 145度
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,左方 47度
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,右方93度
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:37.33,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,FINAL ATTACKRIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:40.29,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,DIEND
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,PERFECT WEAPON
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:14:57.77,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:15:00.06,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,混蛋小偷输了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏时间结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你的游戏伙伴只有那家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.11,0:15:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,夏娃是最适合我的完美搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,老实投降就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.41,0:15:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你的行动模式已经被我看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,人类不值得信任
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但是夏娃是可以信任的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.71,0:15:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,因为它不会犯和人类一样的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你去监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:37.18,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,小哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:39.10,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道你是哪里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.19,0:15:40.19,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,但你挺厉害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:41.44,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,你刚才
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.48,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,没有搭乘Den-Liner
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:44.69,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,就回到了过去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.93,0:15:45.56,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.57,0:15:45.90,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了这位人工异魔神夏娃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:52.45,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,你说 人工异魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们时间警察
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:55.74,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,它说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,成功制造出了人工异魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我是当中的第一号
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫怜治
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,今后将由我们时间警察来逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,妨碍时间运行的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:15.22,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:17.31,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,找到通行证了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:22.81,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,你干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你们被逮捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:26.82,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,逮捕我们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所有扰乱时间的异魔神都要被逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:31.74,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,先等等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:34.20,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,你是说我们扰乱了时间吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我访问了过去的数据
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你们曾多次改变过去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:40.83,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,正好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.46,0:16:43.50,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,想动手的话就试试
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果反抗就行使武力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:51.42,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我觉得你已经这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,被逮捕的只有异魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你将被强制送回原本的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.43,0:17:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怜治 少了一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:19.49,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,想逮捕我 别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:48.52,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,他是这个时间的海东大树
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:50.19,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我家的传家宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:17:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓的宝物就是指无可替代的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:26.64,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,小偷先生从以前开始就是小偷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果反抗就行使武力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:39.95,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我怎么会反抗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.49,0:18:43.33,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,打不开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:46.65,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我投降
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.34,0:18:56.65,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,喂 放了我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:19:00.93,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,放我出去 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.22,0:19:02.18,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,该死的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:03.60,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,拿炸猪排饭来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:06.10,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我要大份的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:07.60,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,有没有人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:09.48,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,就没个人在吗 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:12.90,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,小龙 你脑袋借我用下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.23,0:19:15.69,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,看招 快打开 打开
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.15,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,你在搞什么啊 桃塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.99,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你也快想想办法 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快开门
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了 你们安静点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.29,0:19:26.33,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.70,0:19:27.87,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,还不都是因为你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:30.33,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,偷了Den-Liner才搞成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.25,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}桃塔罗斯你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:33.96,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我也想回家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:39.17,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,老熊 你快醒醒别睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:39.84,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}打他 打他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:43.80,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,看守 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:46.77,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,请你们至少把这只笨熊放回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:49.39,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 只有你能保持安静吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.23,0:19:58.44,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,算是吧 不过内心不是很平静
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.95,0:20:02.07,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,小偷先生是否也同样如此呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.24,0:20:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:08.95,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,你在想什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:10.79,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,应该不平静吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:13.50,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,竟然想偷走Den-Liner
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.09,0:20:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我只会思考跟宝物有关的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:20.97,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,宝物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:24.97,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,比如那个盒子里的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,盒子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那是最适合让我偷走的宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.61,0:20:44.41,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别跟他说话 臭龟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:47.78,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,听那家伙说话让我直起鸡皮疙瘩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:50.25,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,不是鸡皮 应该是桃皮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:52.37,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,对对 表面很粗糙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:54.71,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不过剥掉一层皮就滑溜溜的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.54,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别引我上钩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.59,0:20:57.46,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,还是上钩了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:20:59.30,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你赶紧给我醒过来 真是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:20:59.75,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.05,0:21:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是没法掺和进你们的相声
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:04.84,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,角 我的角
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这里面的人应该是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,爱理小姐的爸爸和妈妈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 这是小良小时候画给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真是幅倾注心血的好画啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.34,0:21:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,只有在画里 我们才能全家团聚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.67,0:21:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,太感人了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定会让爱理小姐幸福的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,恶灵退散
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你小子在给别人幸福前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.77,0:21:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,先诅咒自己的不幸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你说谁不幸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:21:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是不幸本身
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:01.57,DefaultTOP,,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我说你就是不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.90,0:22:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前和浦塔罗斯还勉强能联系上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.87,0:22:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他说海东大树在2年前的11月22日
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,从黑崎家偷了某样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.79,0:22:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他偷走了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.71,0:22:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.50,0:22:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他还没说完就联系断掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,说到11月22日
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个结婚的好日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我和爱理小姐总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说到黑崎家
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.47,0:22:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得那是个地位很高的伯爵家
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.69,0:22:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们家好像发生过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你该不会是想说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.24,0:22:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,关于伯爵家的传家宝之类的小道消息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.95,0:22:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对 对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是一把镶了钻石的传家宝手枪不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:22:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.37,0:22:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 尾崎先生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.75,0:23:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,只要能帮上弟弟的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是你弟弟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.67,0:23:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.55,0:23:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙在这儿瞎攀什么亲戚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.67,0:23:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,海东大树又一次盯上了那把手枪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.59,0:23:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才回到了两年前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.09,0:23:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可是曾经得手的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.18,0:23:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么还要再偷一次呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.77,0:23:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这得去调查下才知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.60,0:23:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还得去救笨蛋桃子他们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.44,0:23:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真是让人操心的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.03,0:23:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,久违的羊栖菜沙拉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.45,0:23:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有干劲做事是很好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但要注意补充营养
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.96,0:23:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你会和以前一样长不大的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.71,0:23:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.01,0:23:51.72,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,喘不过气
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.76,0:23:55.60,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.10,0:24:02.06,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,总算到吃饭时间了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.81,0:24:04.65,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,早上好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.61,0:24:09.32,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你除了吃就是睡吗 冬眠熊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.74,0:24:10.49,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.66,0:24:19.83,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,是时间警察
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.06,0:24:37.18,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,还不开饭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.56,0:24:38.18,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我讨厌这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.31,0:24:40.31,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,甜点要加布丁哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.35,0:24:41.35,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:42.56,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你敢无视我 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.06,0:24:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,海东大树
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.32,0:24:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你明天就要接受审判了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.02,0:24:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真是笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.61,0:24:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我才能审判我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.04,0:24:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你就一辈子住在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我要夺走你最重要的宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.84,0:25:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想夺走我的自由吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.51,0:25:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓的宝物就是指无可替代的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.97,0:25:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.97,0:25:18.97,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,那句话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.06,0:25:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓的宝物就是指无可替代的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.64,0:25:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.28,0:25:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,太过于执着 可会被人讨厌的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.41,0:25:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的审判也是明天
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.04,0:25:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,做好准备吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:42.62,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我们也要受审判啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.96,0:25:44.62,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,怎么办 怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.21,0:25:46.25,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,都是这个人不好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.29,0:25:46.79,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,都是他 都是他
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.83,0:25:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,车长
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.92,0:25:53.55,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,车长来救我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.63,0:25:55.26,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,车长 快救我们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.51,0:25:56.22,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,快救我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.26,0:25:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们至今为止打倒了很多异魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.26,0:26:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,守护了时间的运行
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.93,0:26:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,请看在他们立过功的份上
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.89,0:26:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,放过他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.52,0:26:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊 就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.40,0:26:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.27,0:26:09.19,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.57,0:26:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我调查了过去的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.94,0:26:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,车长曾多次放任Den-O改变过去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.99,0:26:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有报告这个罪犯的劫持行为
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.87,0:26:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你等于是当了罪犯的帮凶
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.62,0:26:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,无论多么微小的罪行
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.46,0:26:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,时间警察也不会放过
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.50,0:26:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,逮捕他
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.54,0:26:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.71,0:26:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.50,0:26:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.67,0:26:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那么Den-Liner呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.01,0:26:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,交给人类的话一定还会犯错误
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.43,0:26:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,今后就交给时间警察使用
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.22,0:26:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,带走
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.82,0:26:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.14,0:26:43.97,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,车长
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.14,0:26:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.52,0:26:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不 请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.65,0:26:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人并没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.03,0:26:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才我说话太任性 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.15,0:26:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也不当小偷了 请你原谅他
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.12,0:27:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.30,0:27:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到你竟然堕落到这个地步
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.09,0:27:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我看错你了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.60,0:27:31.65,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,被打了啊 活该
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.45,0:27:39.49,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你是为了拿到钥匙才故意演戏的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.99,0:27:40.82,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.82,0:27:42.41,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,小子挺能干的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.45,0:27:43.41,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不 不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.41,0:27:46.29,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,顺便把我们的门也打开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.01,0:27:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,打开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:49.21,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,对对 打开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.50,0:27:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,打 开 吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.05,0:27:56.50,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不 那个 打开
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.05,0:27:59.34,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,请你帮忙我们开下门
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.38,0:28:00.84,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我受够这种生活了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.05,0:28:03.14,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,逃出生天以前 要不要联手呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.35,0:28:04.01,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,对啊 对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.06,0:28:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你们会拖后腿的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.39,0:28:06.10,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.22,0:28:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在我搞到Den-Liner前
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.77,0:28:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就老实呆着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.65,0:28:14.31,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.02,0:28:15.65,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不坦率的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.73,0:28:16.86,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,这家伙也还不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.40,0:28:18.07,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,确实呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.71,0:28:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,怜治先生 不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.38,0:28:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是Den-Liner的客舱乘务员吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.09,0:28:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,来得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.51,0:28:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你也被逮捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.38,0:28:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,先别说这些 海东大树越狱了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.72,0:28:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.69,0:28:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.31,0:28:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没有车票的话
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.23,0:28:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Den-Liner是不会动的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.91,0:29:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,您在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.62,0:29:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,又想去那个时间吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.87,0:29:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,海东大树
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.42,0:29:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是为了宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.30,0:29:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去失去的宝物永远也回不来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.01,0:29:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,弄坏了我们家手枪的人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不就是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.73,0:29:40.03,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,像这样把卫生纸卷起来 卷起来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.70,0:29:43.49,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,再折过来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.82,0:29:44.61,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.53,0:29:48.53,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,靠你啦 姓桃的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.03,0:29:48.99,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.25,0:29:51.79,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,要上了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.00,0:29:52.33,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.37,0:29:53.87,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,过来 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.91,0:29:54.50,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,还差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.62,0:29:56.25,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,过来 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.42,0:29:57.25,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,根本不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.88,0:29:58.63,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.67,0:30:00.13,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,竟然这么精准
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.17,0:30:02.46,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,就放在差一点能够到的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.67,0:30:02.88,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}小龙 推他
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.30,0:30:04.84,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好疼 好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.34,0:30:06.76,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}前辈 避开关节处啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.97,0:30:07.72,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,就差一点了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.35,0:30:09.14,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.56,0:30:10.31,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,叶奈
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.81,0:30:12.39,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,你们俩都被逮捕了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.81,0:30:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.98,0:30:16.10,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,过去 我们可还被关着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.86,0:30:18.73,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.36,0:30:20.48,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,还有这招
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.19,0:30:21.90,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.41,0:30:29.57,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.20,0:30:32.20,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,老子 登场
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.75,0:30:37.50,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.54,0:30:39.54,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我的贡献不就变少了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.63,0:30:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 快点干掉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.94,0:31:06.03,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,成功了 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.74,0:31:08.45,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,钥匙 掉在那里了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.66,0:31:12.33,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,快点 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.58,0:31:13.33,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 叶奈
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.37,0:31:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,海东大树呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.16,0:31:14.87,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.04,0:31:16.58,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,他去抢Den-Liner了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.92,0:31:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,车长人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.71,0:31:23.38,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,快回答 老龟
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:24.92,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,疼 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.96,0:31:25.71,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我也不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.76,0:31:27.05,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,老熊 你也说点什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.02,0:31:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,车长
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.43,0:31:37.98,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}好厉害 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.60,0:31:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那位小偷先生像是有什么难言之隐
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.44,0:31:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我去调查
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.44,0:31:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快逃出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.11,0:31:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我和站长有要事商量
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.91,0:32:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Den-Liner就拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.32,0:32:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.09,0:32:09.30,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,好 快穿上
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.43,0:32:11.22,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我们得抢在混蛋小偷前面
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:12.97,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,夺回Den-Liner
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.96,0:32:12.65,DefaultTOP,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.01,0:32:13.64,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.76,0:32:14.30,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.10,0:32:17.81,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,跳下去一瞬间就到了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.84,0:32:16.94,DefaultTOP,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.60,0:32:18.60,DefaultTOP,,0,0,0,,不行 太高了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.14,0:32:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.69,0:32:21.52,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,走吧 小龙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.94,0:32:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,出发啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.07,0:32:29.86,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,拉线在哪儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.24,0:32:32.74,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,找到了 就是它
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.95,0:32:34.70,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,奇怪 拔出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.41,0:32:37.99,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.04,0:32:41.83,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,为什么会这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.87,0:32:42.46,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.71,0:32:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不需要审判了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.22,0:32:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,当场处刑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.18,0:32:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 这下终于能和你做个了断
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.56,0:32:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.68,0:33:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,总是按照人工异魔神的指示行动
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.90,0:33:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,到底谁才是人类呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.61,0:33:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该说过
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.15,0:33:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,夏娃的指示是完美的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.28,0:33:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,人类不值得信任
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.61,0:33:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才没有同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.66,0:33:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要什么同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.33,0:33:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.20,0:33:17.78,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.74,0:33:19.99,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,前辈 你没藏好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.04,0:33:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,又要求我饶你一命吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.46,0:33:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,叫桃子还有金什么的那帮家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.96,0:33:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,要溜进车里了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.21,0:33:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.63,0:33:28.55,DefaultTOP,,0,0,0,,快一点 抓紧时间
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.84,0:33:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再上你的当了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.76,0:33:36.34,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,一把钓到大鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.76,0:33:37.89,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,圆满成功
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.10,0:33:37.89,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.89,0:33:38.60,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,中计了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.18,0:33:41.06,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,Den-Liner物归原主
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.18,0:33:42.06,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.87,0:34:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也没必要审判了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.75,0:34:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,全体处刑
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.80,0:34:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.97,0:34:17.43,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.51,0:34:19.39,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.14,0:34:21.64,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我们现在先去哪儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.19,0:34:26.35,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,旅行的目的地由我决定
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.56,0:34:28.40,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.28,0:34:33.86,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.95,0:34:43.54,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.29,0:34:47.25,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,Den-Liner被他拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:47.79,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.79,0:34:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在2008年11月22日让我下车
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.76,0:34:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我就把车还给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.01,0:34:57.68,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,你在那个时间对那个少年说过的话
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.05,0:34:59.93,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,那个叫怜治的家伙也说过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.47,0:35:03.72,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,也就是说那个少年就是怜治吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.11,0:35:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,能告诉我理由吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.49,0:35:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,和你们没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.58,0:35:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经没有车票了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.50,0:35:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所以只有让Den-O驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.50,0:35:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,才能前往你想到达的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.54,0:35:29.83,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,如果不能说服良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.33,0:35:32.54,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,他绝不会替你驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.21,0:35:36.13,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,这家伙的顽固程度也不一般呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.76,0:35:38.09,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,快点告诉他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.52,0:35:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那是件无聊的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.39,0:35:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,2年前的某一天
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.90,0:35:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我偷走了一样宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.28,0:35:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.49,0:36:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我家的传家宝啊 还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.57,0:36:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.62,0:36:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓的宝物就是指无可替代的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.08,0:36:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.42,0:36:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候遇到的少年就是怜治
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.63,0:36:17.84,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,也就是说他对此心怀怨恨
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.88,0:36:19.72,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,所以当上了时间警察
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.93,0:36:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我对那些事没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.76,0:36:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在说宝物的事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.01,0:37:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.27,0:37:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.77,0:37:15.77,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,就因为这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.61,0:37:20.90,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,你回到过去是为了再次偷到宝物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.11,0:37:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这个理由对我来说足够了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.36,0:37:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,宝物竟然因为被我偷走而损坏
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.78,0:37:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不符合我海东大树的名号
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.33,0:37:30.54,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,愚蠢至极
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.96,0:37:32.91,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,我们怎么可能帮助小偷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.00,0:37:34.08,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.13,0:37:34.96,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,对吧 良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.59,0:37:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.17,0:37:43.09,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.76,0:37:45.64,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我也同意良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.26,0:37:48.43,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我倒想看看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.22,0:37:50.18,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,他的话里究竟还藏着些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.52,0:37:52.14,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,别说傻话了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.35,0:37:53.56,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,别激动 前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.99,0:38:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我就问一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.79,0:38:11.49,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.79,0:38:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你是为了那个宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.33,0:38:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才想抹杀自己吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.04,0:38:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,为了宝物 我可以豁出性命
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.42,0:38:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不能失去宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.39,0:38:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那就让我看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.06,0:38:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你的宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.19,0:38:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.98,0:38:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但我并不讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.82,0:38:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.79,0:38:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我家的传家宝啊 还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.91,0:38:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.76,0:39:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓的宝物就是指无可替代的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.63,0:39:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.52,0:39:19.06,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.69,0:39:24.32,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.87,0:39:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,时间警察吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.37,0:39:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,处死逃犯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.04,0:39:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.22,0:39:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.05,0:39:53.26,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.72,0:39:54.89,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎 我们上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.78,0:39:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.89,0:40:00.31,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,SWORD FORM
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.34,0:40:01.02,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.48,0:40:05.07,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,这就交给我对付吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.74,0:40:07.86,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,为我的强大而哭泣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.57,0:40:12.45,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,又窜出来抢戏 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.37,0:40:21.46,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,FULL CHARGE
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.25,0:40:25.34,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,车票得收好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.76,0:40:28.20,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,强力猛劈
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.81,0:40:38.60,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我也要战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.64,0:40:40.31,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,好 再试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.23,0:40:43.69,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,GUN FORM
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.73,0:40:47.11,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我要打倒你 可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.57,0:40:48.65,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,你的回答并不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.66,0:40:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,右方127度
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.63,0:41:05.25,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,你连背后都看得见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.84,0:41:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真让人生气
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.88,0:41:08.63,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你在干什么 给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.17,0:41:10.42,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,SWORD FORM
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.34,0:41:13.76,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,老子登场
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.89,0:41:17.60,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,一旦开打就是火力全开
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.97,0:41:20.14,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.11,0:41:30.32,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,疼 疼 疼
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.66,0:41:34.20,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.00,0:41:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.00,0:41:47.25,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,真会挑时候
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.22,0:41:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,处刑 消灭他
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.98,0:42:02.89,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.27,0:42:08.65,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,话里藏千针
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.98,0:42:11.32,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,在我看到真相之前
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.65,0:42:13.36,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,可不能让你死了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.53,0:42:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.99,0:42:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快点从我身体里出去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.37,0:42:17.82,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.87,0:42:18.87,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,那家伙搞什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.62,0:42:20.20,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,笨龟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.49,0:42:22.37,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,别这么无情嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.92,0:42:25.83,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,KAMEN RIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.88,0:42:26.62,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.00,0:42:28.04,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,DIEND
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.84,0:42:36.47,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,试着上我的钩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.58,0:42:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,消灭他
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.76,0:42:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.99,0:42:58.07,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,这可麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.74,0:42:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,右方162度
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.95,0:43:01.99,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.08,0:43:07.17,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,谢谢 前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.75,0:43:09.13,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你在干什么呢 老龟
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.29,0:43:11.34,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,赶紧从他身体里出来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.75,0:43:12.80,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我们一起攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.05,0:43:15.09,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,少指挥我 你这个混蛋小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.59,0:43:16.93,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,90)}ATTACKRIDE INVISIBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.93,0:43:16.88,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,靠你了 前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.72,0:43:19.58,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,必杀
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.58,0:43:20.60,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,FULL CHARGE
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.68,0:43:24.22,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,老子的必杀技 第三招
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.57,0:43:40.53,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,得手了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.03,0:43:41.78,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.71,0:43:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 站住
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.17,0:44:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你想在这个时间里做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.09,0:44:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.50,0:45:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我得谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.08,0:45:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,全靠你才保住了宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.17,0:46:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法干涉自己的过往
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.47,0:46:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,于是就想到让你来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.14,0:46:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.85,0:46:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你做这些
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.39,0:46:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了完好无缺地拿到那把枪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.59,0:46:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.22,0:46:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,它们曾和枪一起装在那个盒子里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.82,0:47:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这原本也已经永远地遗失了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.07,0:47:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,只是些废纸罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.99,0:47:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不是废纸哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.21,0:47:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,叶奈
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.21,0:47:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是你妈妈写给你的信
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.55,0:47:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那种东西还有什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.34,0:47:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在我小时候就离开家抛弃了我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.01,0:47:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一直无视我的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.14,0:47:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是个冷血的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.85,0:47:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.97,0:47:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈有好几次都想跟你见面
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.23,0:47:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,她每天给你写信
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.94,0:47:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一封又一封地写
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.57,0:47:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可是那些信都没有送到你手里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.57,0:47:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,被人藏了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.66,0:47:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈一直都爱着你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.21,0:48:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,而且这些信中
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.50,0:48:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,充满了你妈妈对你的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.05,0:48:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,海东 你难道是为了把这些信
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.60,0:48:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要有奇怪的误解
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.73,0:48:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我的目标始终都是宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.94,0:48:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈现在也还想见见你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.45,0:48:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,事到如今 你跟我说这些
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.95,0:48:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,也无法消除我的恨意
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.62,0:48:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这些废纸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.42,0:48:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.60,0:48:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,的确是堆废纸
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.98,0:49:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是对某些人来说
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.95,0:49:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,也许就是宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.39,0:49:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然它们可能本就不会交到你手上
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.23,0:49:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但是却因为我永远地遗失了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.86,0:49:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不允许宝物遗失
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.66,0:49:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怜治 除掉罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.66,0:50:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.46,0:50:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怜治 你在等什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.50,0:50:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.92,0:50:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,怜治
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.31,0:50:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,正因如此 人类才都不可信
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.57,0:50:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他独自变身了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.87,0:50:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界要由人工异魔神来管理
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.09,0:50:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.73,0:51:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.02,0:51:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有两个嫌犯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.82,0:51:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你们有点过节
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.49,0:51:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可别恨我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.91,0:51:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你也来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.50,0:51:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,少命令我了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.54,0:51:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我才能命令我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.38,0:51:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好说了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.13,0:51:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来自未来的你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.13,0:51:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.69,0:51:47.64,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,KAMEN RIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.90,0:51:48.44,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.85,0:51:49.90,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,DIEND
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.03,0:51:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,为了彻底地管理好时间
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.07,0:52:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,必须消灭所有人类
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.96,0:52:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,后面的事情就靠你了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.21,0:52:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,未来的我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.55,0:52:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.63,0:52:18.80,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,ATTACKRIDE INVISIBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.97,0:52:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.11,0:52:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,良太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.69,0:52:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯 我们上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.90,0:52:38.03,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我正等着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.07,0:52:39.07,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我也是 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.11,0:52:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.28,0:52:42.53,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,SWORD FORM
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.80,0:52:58.05,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,马上就把你收拾了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.17,0:53:38.63,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,小金
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.18,0:53:48.01,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.56,0:53:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,浦塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.56,0:53:51.18,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,就这种攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.35,0:53:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,龙塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.15,0:53:55.36,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,不能哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.36,0:53:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,金塔罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.48,0:53:58.73,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.78,0:53:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.20,0:54:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\clip(m 751 1055 l 926 1054 794 955)}CLIMAX FORM
Dialogue: 1,0:54:06.20,0:54:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HB27906&\3c&HFFFFFF&\clip(m 829 984 l 932 1059 984 1058 982 982)}CLIMAX FORM
Dialogue: 2,0:54:06.20,0:54:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H56CBF2&\3c&HFFFFFF&\clip(m 985 976 l 994 1067 1110 1052 1032 986)}CLIMAX FORM
Dialogue: 3,0:54:06.20,0:54:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HED77AA&\3c&HFFFFFF&\clip(m 1009 982 l 1106 1059 1152 1054 1150 974)}CLIMAX FORM
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.71,0:54:11.25,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,合体
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.29,0:54:11.79,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.96,0:54:13.08,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我们上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.38,0:54:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,夏娃身上没有弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.34,0:54:23.76,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.97,0:54:25.43,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,既然他没有弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.05,0:54:27.30,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,那就从正面进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.01,0:54:29.93,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,也就是姑且拼一把
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.27,0:54:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真是糟糕的战术
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.68,0:54:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但我并不讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.65,0:54:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,必杀
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.52,0:54:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\2c&HFFFFFF&\clip(778,974,1156,1010)}FULL CHARGE
Dialogue: 1,0:54:35.52,0:54:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HB27906&\2c&HFFFFFF&\clip(766,1010,1130,1020)}FULL CHARGE
Dialogue: 2,0:54:35.52,0:54:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H56CBF2&\2c&HFFFFFF&\clip(760,1020,1142,1054)}FULL CHARGE
Dialogue: 3,0:54:35.52,0:54:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HED77AA&\2c&HFFFFFF&\clip(768,1030,1136,1066)}FULL CHARGE
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.56,0:54:37.98,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,FINAL ATTACKRIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.11,0:54:40.61,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,我们的正面进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.57,0:54:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,PERFECT WEAPON
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.99,0:54:44.32,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,DIEND
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.82,0:54:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.76,0:55:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.05,0:55:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,宝物没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.77,0:55:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么时候也能够信任别人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.20,0:55:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.91,0:55:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,假如你可以相信自己的宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.16,0:55:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那一天一定会到来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.56,0:55:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的新宝物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.52,0:56:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,G4 RYUGA ORGA GLAIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.65,0:56:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,KABUKI CAUCASUS ARC SKULL
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.23,0:56:04.69,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,FINAL KAMEN RIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.61,0:56:07.99,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,DIEND
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.84,0:56:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,特供超值福利
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.38,0:56:26.92,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,ATTACKRIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.18,0:56:30.34,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,剧场版
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.24,0:56:56.08,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,FINAL ATTACKRIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.75,0:56:57.79,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,DIEND
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.87,0:57:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.44,0:57:27.69,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你这身是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.29,0:57:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,小偷先生所说的宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.01,0:57:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是人们的思念吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.80,0:57:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.76,0:57:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就舍弃那些东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.85,0:58:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你现在一直在寻找宝物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.65,0:58:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,失去的时间再也找不回来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.98,0:58:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.40,0:58:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,人们的思念日积月累
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.57,0:58:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是也就能变成时间了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.35,0:58:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经打烊了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.44,0:58:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能简单地帮我包一束花
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.49,0:58:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.20,0:59:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.95,0:59:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他现在应该已经长大一些了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.05,0:59:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没见面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.46,0:59:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为一些事情
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.34,0:59:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,已经两年多没见了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.35,1:00:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定感觉我是个冷漠的母亲
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.31,1:00:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,十分怨恨我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.31,1:00:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 说了些奇怪的话
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.90,1:00:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我想没有孩子会怨恨自己的母亲
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.75,1:00:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.88,1:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.97,1:00:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不用给钱了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.47,1:00:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的话让我很开心
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.43,1:00:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这样感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.72,1:00:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是送给谁的礼物呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.89,1:00:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,送给母亲
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.69,1:01:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你母亲一定会高兴的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.20,1:01:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.84,1:02:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎再次光临
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.93,1:02:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.47,1:02:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天 一定
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.11,1:02:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,在未来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.55,1:02:48.26,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,气死我了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.76,1:02:51.47,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那个叫大树的混蛋小偷
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.73,1:02:52.81,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,桃塔罗斯 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.02,1:02:57.23,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我还以为他的话里有隐情
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.48,1:02:58.61,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,居然什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.28,1:03:02.40,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,结果手枪也被他拿走了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.45,1:03:04.82,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,说到底只有他得到了宝物
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.03,1:03:09.83,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,良太郎 你帮了那么多忙
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.99,1:03:12.12,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,可那家伙又做了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.62,1:03:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他守护了宝物
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.42,1:03:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.67,1:03:19.88,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,你说守护了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.42,1:03:23.34,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,就因为这个让我们吃了那么多苦头
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.72,1:03:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 遗失的时间也完好送达了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.60,1:03:32.64,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.81,1:03:33.98,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.98,1:03:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 这不也挺好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.11,1:03:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,总之 托他的福
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.15,1:03:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,时间警察对我们重新进行了评估
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.19,1:03:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也能继续旅行了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.49,1:03:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,因此
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.62,1:03:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,站长 您可以出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.75,1:03:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.54,1:03:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,新战斗的帷幕
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.67,1:04:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,终于要拉开了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.96,1:04:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.84,1:04:04.71,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,也就是说至今为止
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.76,1:04:06.30,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,看似毫无意义的行动背后
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.80,1:04:08.26,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,难道隐藏着重要的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.55,1:04:10.09,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.43,1:04:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,直美
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.47,1:04:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.44,1:04:20.38,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,那个是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.03,1:04:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.54,1:04:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你请
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.79,1:04:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,您先请
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.42,1:04:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 你请
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.85,1:04:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我选择中式大勺一号
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.81,1:04:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,11米40
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.99,1:05:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.26,1:05:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.05,1:05:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那一杆还不错
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.30,1:05:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是手很稳的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.98,1:05:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就用红色的长柄勺
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.27,1:05:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,8米17
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.02,1:05:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是这儿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.37,1:06:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二 三
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.30,1:06:10.06,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.51,1:06:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,您也有一手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.01,1:06:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要拿出我珍藏的宝贝了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.52,1:06:20.14,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,好有意思
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.18,1:06:20.64,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,我睡了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.27,1:06:26.69,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,难道隐藏着重要的 究竟是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.90,1:06:27.40,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.90,1:06:30.11,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我很久没觉得自己这么丢人了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.07,1:06:32.15,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.53,1:06:35.32,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,我也想玩 去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.28,1:06:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,11米03
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.55,1:06:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,棒极了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.80,1:06:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得直美才是最厉害的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.47,1:06:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.39,1:07:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,咖啡来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.94,1:07:04.56,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.35,1:07:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,请用
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.23,1:07:06.98,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,正是时候
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.44,1:07:09.57,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 小直美
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.69,1:07:10.28,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.36,1:07:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.28,1:07:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.91,1:07:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,没找到良太郎的杯子
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.14,1:07:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.84,1:07:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,难道
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.59,1:07:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也许没有机会再见面了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.14,1:07:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 我绝不会忘记你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.57,1:07:57.95,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,混蛋 说到底都是怪你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.37,1:08:00.12,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我也是受害人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.08,1:08:02.83,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,疼 疼 你们干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.87,1:08:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,穿梭时空的列车 Den-Liner
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.38,1:08:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,下一站是过去还是未来呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.50,1:08:13.67,ED,,0,0,0,,真棒 真棒 真强
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.04,1:08:16.67,ED,,0,0,0,,真棒 真棒 真强
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.05,1:08:19.76,ED,,0,0,0,,真棒 真棒 真强
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.01,1:08:22.72,ED,,0,0,0,,真棒 真棒 真强
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.64,1:08:34.35,ED,,0,0,0,,自身之中到底是谁 打算开始骚动
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.65,1:08:40.24,ED,,0,0,0,,老子正等待时机 无法克制的冲动
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.24,1:08:46.53,ED,,0,0,0,,自身之中到底是谁 打算开始骚动
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.53,1:08:52.29,ED,,0,0,0,,没有虚伪 的确很强 你也试试上我的钩
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.46,1:08:55.71,ED,,0,0,0,,在遥遥流长的旅行中
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.71,1:08:58.92,ED,,0,0,0,,为了一生一次的相遇
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.92,1:09:00.63,ED,,0,0,0,,举起双手
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.63,1:09:01.84,ED,,0,0,0,,超麻烦啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.84,1:09:04.64,ED,,0,0,0,,就战斗吧 耶耶耶
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.01,1:09:07.35,ED,,0,0,0,,真棒 真强
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.68,1:09:12.64,ED,,0,0,0,,开始总是这么突然
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.27,1:09:19.57,ED,,0,0,0,,走向注定的命运里 Time trippin' ride
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.78,1:09:24.86,ED,,0,0,0,,改变并不可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.41,1:09:31.58,ED,,0,0,0,,可怕的是自己迷失在明日里
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.58,1:09:33.79,ED,,0,0,0,,要比谁都高
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.54,1:09:36.63,ED,,0,0,0,,比昨日更高
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.63,1:09:37.83,ED,,0,0,0,,Climax Jump !
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.63,1:09:43.51,ED,,0,0,0,,已经不能再就此放任
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.51,1:09:46.59,ED,,0,0,0,,为了悲伤的历史
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.59,1:09:47.68,ED,,0,0,0,,不再存在
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.93,1:09:49.47,ED,,0,0,0,,仅仅如此
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.47,1:09:55.89,ED,,0,0,0,,真正的强者 Action-Zero
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.11,1:10:05.24,ED,,0,0,0,,开始总是这么突然
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.86,1:10:12.12,ED,,0,0,0,,走向注定的命运里 Time trippin' ride
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.12,1:10:17.21,ED,,0,0,0,,直至昨日的记忆都是重要的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.75,1:10:24.01,ED,,0,0,0,,真相大白之定会到来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.26,1:10:26.63,ED,,0,0,0,,要比谁都高
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.09,1:10:29.14,ED,,0,0,0,,比昨日更高
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.14,1:10:30.80,ED,,0,0,0,,Climax Jump !
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.85,1:10:33.14,ED,,0,0,0,,真棒 真棒 真强
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.68,1:10:43.53,ED,,0,0,0,,真棒 真棒 真强 Climax  Jump !
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.01,1:11:16.10,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,疼 这个混蛋小偷
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.10,1:11:18.10,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.19,1:11:21.06,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,前辈 你不知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.06,1:11:23.77,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,我们是没法走出屏幕的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.07,1:11:28.86,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,是啊 因为我们是在所谓电脑的画面里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.99,1:11:33.70,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 笨蛋 桃塔罗斯笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.54,1:11:38.79,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,吵死了 小子 你才是笨蛋呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.04,1:11:42.33,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,不会有那样的事吧...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.38,1:11:48.34,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.43,1:11:54.01,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,感觉刚才好像有在制作的人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.01,1:11:58.60,Kintaros,,0,0,0,,不过 桃兄 无论如何都想走出屏幕的话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.85,1:12:03.19,Urataros/Diend,,0,0,0,,也并不是没有方法 但只有一个 前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.11,1:12:06.61,Momotaros,,0,0,0,,什么啊？ 那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.32,1:12:09.86,Ryutaros,,0,0,0,,走出这部电影就可以了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.95,1:12:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shroud
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.71,1:12:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,跳起舞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.25,1:12:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是死神的派对时间
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.55,1:12:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,占领风都塔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.21,1:12:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,抢夺次世代盖亚记忆体
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.70,1:12:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.38,1:12:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,主谋者是
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.68,1:12:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,最强的假面骑士
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.26,1:12:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,最强的假面骑士
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.26,1:12:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternal
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.22,1:12:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要是让那些家伙用记忆体出来作乱的话
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.01,1:12:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,风都就完了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.05,1:13:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫像我啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.34,1:13:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这些的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.68,1:13:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我真正的父母
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.80,1:13:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,假面骑士W
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.22,1:13:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,FOREVER AtoZ/命运的盖亚记忆体
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.97,1:13:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,少年啊 成为男子汉吧
